From: Magnus Lindholm <linmag7@gmail.com>
Subject: [RFC PATCH 00/16] sparc64: archive Oberon error experiments on M3000 v5

Port the fifteen historical error-interrupt implementation commits onto
M3000 v5 and document the dependency and remaining limitations. This is
an experimental personal-repository branch, not a Linux-list submission.
The original v4 branch remains intact. Old MSI patches are not included.

The port applied without conflicts and retained all original patch IDs.
The v5 foundation and error code touch disjoint files; the complete delta
between old and new implementation trees equals the v4-to-v5 base delta.
No new build or boot test was performed. Historical testing does not
qualify this exact stack. See README.rst for the known recovery limits.

This series contains 15 implementation commits and one documentation commit.
All commits carry Magnus Lindholm's sign-off. The archived bounded MSI
series is separate and has not been combined with this branch.

Direct prerequisite: archive/2026-11-18/fujitsu/m3000-v5
